// =====================================================================
// PICTURE CUTSCENES
// Full-screen pictures with typed text under them (CutsceneView).
//
//     <<cutscene_image "sprite_name">>  open the cutscene / change the picture
//     <<cutscene_image_keep_text "sprite_name">>
//                                       change the picture, the last text stays
//                                       (next tap goes on; no line needed under it)
//     any line                          types out under the picture
//     <<cutscene_end>>                  fade the cutscene out
//
// - Tap: finish typing. Tap again: next line, or next picture.
// - Put as many lines under a picture as you need.
// - A picture with no line under it waits for one tap.
// - A line with "Name: text" shows the name too ("Anin: ...Again.").
// - No choices (->) inside a picture cutscene.
// - Every sprite used here must be in the CutsceneView's Pictures list.
//
// Play from another node with <<detour Cutscene_FalFall>>: the cutscene
// plays, then the node goes on from the next line.
// =====================================================================


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// PROLOGUE: first thing the game shows after the Title Screen.
// Played by the YarnCutscene in the Prologue scene, which loads the Dorm after it.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Cutscene_Prologue
tags: cutscene
---
<<cutscene_image "cutscene_prologue_1">>
Today, the school held a festival to celebrate graduation tomorrow. Everyone was having fun: the band, the bazaar, the games, all the stalls the other classes set up.

<<cutscene_image "cutscene_prologue_2a">>
We were having fun too. It felt like the best day of my life. Before high school, I never had friends like this.

<<cutscene_image_keep_text "cutscene_prologue_2b">>

<<cutscene_image "cutscene_prologue_3a">>
In a few hours, it all ends. I don’t want this to end.

<<cutscene_image "cutscene_prologue_3b">>
I wish I could stay in high school forever.

<<cutscene_image_keep_text "cutscene_prologue_3c">>

<<cutscene_end>>
===


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// FAL FALLS: locker room, every scene where Fal falls.
// Played with <<detour Cutscene_FalFall>> (scene1 Lockers_FriendsArrive, scene3).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Cutscene_FalFall
tags: cutscene
---
<<cutscene_image "cutscene_fals_death_1a">>
It was peaceful evening, everyone's here and Fal will come soon.
Until...

<<cutscene_image "cutscene_fals_death_1b">>
<<sfx "fall_impact">>
Empty

<<cutscene_image_keep_text "cutscene_fals_death_2">>
<<sfx "distant_scream">>

<<cutscene_image "cutscene_fals_death_3a">>
There's crowd at school park. It was too packed you can't see what's happening there.

<<cutscene_image_keep_text "cutscene_fals_death_3b">>

<<cutscene_image_keep_text "cutscene_fals_death_3c">>

<<cutscene_image "cutscene_fals_death_3d">>
...Again

<<cutscene_end>>
===
